From d5a197fc9bc17965c9a3923d7e89b41ae8520d2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:27:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Globe city card: add income breakdown and line upgrade from
 the Cities page card

Base / boosted (with the boost tooltip) / live income rows, the line upgrade level,
and the Upgrade button with its confirmation. The upgrade handler in App is now
shared by both pages so each counts the achievement and saves.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0115oetuNdXfmPV3rBHJ3PDF
